        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐾 About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up as <strong>Katie</strong>, a curious catgirl with black hair, green eyes, and a restless hunger for fish. After a dream of chasing her perfect catch, Katie realizes her house is empty and her stomach is growling. Donning her mysterious <strong>shapeshifting bikini</strong>, she sets out on a whimsical adventure filled with puzzles, exploration, and playful surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌸 A Living, Interactive World</strong><br>Every corner of <i>Catgirl Simulator</i> is designed to be touched, read, and discovered. Flip through <strong>books</strong> full of lore, gaze at <strong>paintings</strong> that hold hidden meaning, play with <strong>catnip</strong> that alters your experience, and uncover <strong>figurines and artifacts</strong> that bring the world to life. An <strong>AI narrator</strong> guides you through the journey while immersive, AI-enhanced imagery makes the adventure feel vibrant and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Puzzles Without Repetition</strong><br>At the heart of <i>Catgirl Simulator</i> lies its greatest strength: <strong>puzzles</strong>. Every challenge you face is different from the last. No two riddles, mazes, or brainteasers feel the same, ensuring the game is <strong>constantly fresh, clever, and full of surprises.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💡 A Passionate Experiment</strong><br>Created by a single developer as a heartfelt surprise for a missing friend, <i>Catgirl Simulator</i> is a project made with love and curiosity. Built entirely in RPG Maker without custom programming, it showcases how much can be done with creativity, dedication, and storytelling alone. This is <strong>Superfantastic Production’s very first RPGMAKER game</strong>, and it wears its experimental heart proudly on its sleeve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Katie, a witty and charming catgirl on a quest for fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly <strong>interactive world</strong> filled with details to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI narration</strong> that reacts to your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible <strong>figurines and artifacts</strong> to aid your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of <strong>unique puzzles</strong> with no filler or repetition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one-of-a-kind <strong>indie RPG Maker experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for adventure? Hungry for fish?<br>Join Katie on her quirky, puzzle-filled quest in <i>Catgirl Simulator</i>!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐾 About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up as <strong>Katie</strong>, a curious catgirl with black hair, green eyes, and a restless hunger for fish. After a dream of chasing her perfect catch, Katie realizes her house is empty and her stomach is growling. Donning her mysterious <strong>shapeshifting bikini</strong>, she sets out on a whimsical adventure filled with puzzles, exploration, and playful surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌸 A Living, Interactive World</strong><br>Every corner of <i>Catgirl Simulator</i> is designed to be touched, read, and discovered. Flip through <strong>books</strong> full of lore, gaze at <strong>paintings</strong> that hold hidden meaning, play with <strong>catnip</strong> that alters your experience, and uncover <strong>figurines and artifacts</strong> that bring the world to life. An <strong>AI narrator</strong> guides you through the journey while immersive, AI-enhanced imagery makes the adventure feel vibrant and alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Puzzles Without Repetition</strong><br>At the heart of <i>Catgirl Simulator</i> lies its greatest strength: <strong>puzzles</strong>. Every challenge you face is different from the last. No two riddles, mazes, or brainteasers feel the same, ensuring the game is <strong>constantly fresh, clever, and full of surprises.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💡 A Passionate Experiment</strong><br>Created by a single developer as a heartfelt surprise for a missing friend, <i>Catgirl Simulator</i> is a project made with love and curiosity. Built entirely in RPG Maker without custom programming, it showcases how much can be done with creativity, dedication, and storytelling alone. This is <strong>Superfantastic Production’s very first RPGMAKER game</strong>, and it wears its experimental heart proudly on its sleeve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✨ Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Katie, a witty and charming catgirl on a quest for fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A highly <strong>interactive world</strong> filled with details to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI narration</strong> that reacts to your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectible <strong>figurines and artifacts</strong> to aid your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of <strong>unique puzzles</strong> with no filler or repetition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A one-of-a-kind <strong>indie RPG Maker experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry for adventure? Hungry for fish?<br>Join Katie on her quirky, puzzle-filled quest in <i>Catgirl Simulator</i>!</p>",
        "short_description": "After dreaming of catching a fish in the clouds, a hungry catgirl wakes with a craving only the perfect fish can satisfy. With none in sight, she sets off on an epic, puzzle-filled journey through space and time—meeting quirky friends and chasing a fish worthy of her feline desires.",
